==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[eye]] [[socket]]}}

# {{anatomy}} The bony cavity which contains the [[eyeball]] and its associated [[muscle]]s, vessels, and [[nerve]]s. In [[human]]s, seven [[bone]]s make up each bony orbit:
#: [[frontal bone]]
#: [[zygomatic bone]]
#: [[maxilla]]
#: [[sphenoid bone]]
#: [[ethmoid bone]]
#: [[palatine bone]]
#: [[lacrimal bone]]

====Synonyms====
* [[cranial orbit]]
* [[orbit]]
* [[orbital cavity]]

